(1, NULL, 0, 'is_single', 0, 'months', NULL, 0, 0, 'months', '60452445', 0.00, 'CODE128', 'H1 LED Light', 200.00, 300.00, 270.00, 250.00, 2, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0.00, '1', 0.00, '1', '75547260_1111.jpg', NULL, 5.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-05-12 12:49:37.000000', '2026-05-12 12:49:37.000000', NULL),
(2, NULL, 0, 'is_single', 0, 'months', 'null', 0, 0, 'months', '1', 0.00, 'CODE128', 'Mobile', 0.00, 2000.00, 1800.00, 0.00, 1, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0.00, '1', 0.00, '1', '71869167_mobile png.png', 'Experience ultimate power and elegance with a smartphone designed to elevate your daily life. Driven by a cutting-edge processor and massive RAM, it delivers flawless multitasking and lag-free gaming at your fingertips. Capture every unforgettable moment in stunning detail with the ultra-clear, pro-grade camera system that excels in any lighting. Plus, with a massive, long-lasting battery and hyper-fast charging, you stay powered up and connected all day long.', 0.00, 0.00, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-06-14 05:01:23.000000', '2026-08-22 14:15:36.000000', NULL),
(3, NULL, 0, 'is_single', 0, 'months', 'null', 0, 0, 'months', '2', 0.00, 'CODE128', 'Laptop', 0.00, 1000.00, 8000.00, 7000.00, 1, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0.00, '1', 0.00, '1', '87306805_laptop png.png', 'Unleash your ultimate productivity and creativity with a laptop built for relentless performance. Power through heavy workloads, complex rendering, and seamless multitasking effortlessly, thanks to its next-generation processor and lightning-fast storage. The stunning, high-resolution display delivers razor-sharp visuals and true-to-life colors, making it perfect for both creators and professionals. Crafted with a sleek, ultra-portable design and an all-day battery life, it gives you the freedom to conquer your goals from anywhere.', 5.00, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-06-14 05:07:54.000000', '2026-09-05 14:02:44.000000', NULL),
(4, NULL, 0, 'is_single', 0, 'months', 'null', 0, 0, 'months', '3', 0.00, 'CODE128', 'Tablet', 880.00, 1220.00, 0.00, 0.00, 1, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0.00, '1', 0.00, '1', '18174511_tablet.jpg', 'Experience the perfect fusion of powerful performance and ultimate portability with this next-generation tablet. Driven by a high-speed processor, it effortlessly handles everything from heavy multitasking and digital sketching to immersive entertainment. The stunning, ultra-responsive touchscreen display brings your visuals to life with brilliant clarity and fluid motion. Engineered with a sleek, lightweight design and an all-day battery life, it is your ultimate powerhouse for productivity and creativity on the go.', 5.00, 0.00, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-06-14 05:11:32.000000', '2026-09-05 14:03:33.000000', NULL),
(5, NULL, 0, 'is_single', 0, 'months', 'null', 0, 0, 'months', '4', 0.00, 'CODE128', 'Television', 450.00, 780.00, 0.00, 0.00, 1, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0.00, '1', 0.00, '1', '30412771_tv.png', 'Transform your living room into a world-class theater with an entertainment experience like never before. Featuring a stunning high-resolution display and advanced color technology, it delivers breathtaking contrast and lifelike details in every single frame. The ultra-slim, bezel-less design blends seamlessly into your space, maximizing your view for pure, uninterrupted immersion. Powered by a lightning-fast smart ecosystem, it gives you instant, seamless access to all your favorite streaming apps, movies, and live shows at the touch of a button.', 5.00, 0.00, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-06-14 05:15:10.000000', '2026-09-05 14:02:36.000000', NULL),
(6, NULL, 0, 'is_single', 24, 'months', 'null', 0, 0, 'months', '56395570', 0.00, 'CODE128', 'Oven', 17900.00, 22500.00, 18400.00, 0.00, 1, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0.00, '1', 0.00, '2', '68191749_oven.jpg', 'Elevate your kitchen and redefine your cooking experience with an oven engineered for ultimate precision and convenience. Featuring advanced heating technology, it ensures uniform heat distribution for perfectly baked, roasted, or defrosted meals every single time. The intuitive, smart control panel offers multiple preset cooking modes, making gourmet meal preparation effortless even on your busiest days. Designed with a sleek, premium exterior and an easy-to-clean interior, it combines high-performance cooking with effortless maintenance for the modern home.', 5.00, 0.00, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-06-14 05:17:25.000000', '2026-08-25 06:50:07.000000', NULL),
(7, NULL, 0, 'is_single', 0, 'months', 'null', 0, 0, 'months', '6', 0.00, 'CODE128', 'Mixer', 550.00, 880.00, 0.00, 0.00, 1, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0.00, '1', 0.00, '1', '35900618_mixer.png', 'Upgrade your culinary game and cut your meal prep time in half with a powerhouse mixer built for the modern kitchen. Equipped with a heavy-duty, high-torque motor and razor-sharp stainless steel blades, it effortlessly crushes, grinds, and blends even the toughest ingredients in seconds. The multi-speed control panel offers absolute precision, allowing you to achieve the perfect texture for smoothies, spices, or batters every single time. Designed with robust, leak-proof jars and an ultra-durable body, it combines maximum performance with long-lasting reliability.', 5.00, 0.00, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-06-14 05:19:19.000000', '2026-09-05 14:02:24.000000', NULL),
(8, NULL, 0, 'is_single', 0, 'months', 'null', 0, 0, 'months', '7', 0.00, 'CODE128', 'Speaker', 50.00, 150.00, 0.00, 0.00, 1, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0.00, '1', 0.00, '1', '90876145_speaker.jpg', 'Bring your music, movies, and games to life with an audio experience that fills every corner of the room. Engineered with advanced acoustic drivers, it delivers crystal-clear highs, rich mids, and deep, thumping bass that you can truly feel. The seamless wireless connectivity ensures instant, lag-free pairing with all your devices, giving you uninterrupted playback. Crafted with a sleek, modern aesthetic and a rugged, long-lasting battery, it is the ultimate powerhouse designed to fuel your sound wherever you go.', 5.00, 0.00, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-06-14 05:22:10.000000', '2026-09-05 14:02:11.000000', NULL),
(9, NULL, 0, 'is_single', 0, 'months', 'null', 0, 0, 'months', '8', 0.00, 'CODE128', 'Washing Machine', 10.00, 80.00, 0.00, 0.00, 1, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0.00, '1', 0.00, '1', '73937617_washing machine.png', 'Revolutionize your laundry routine and give your clothes the premium care they deserve with an ultra-efficient washing machine. Driven by advanced smart-wash technology, it automatically senses fabric types and stains to deliver a powerful yet gentle clean every single time. The high-speed inverter motor maximizes performance while drastically cutting down on energy and water consumption. Designed with an elegant exterior and an intuitive control panel, it removes the hassle from laundry day, leaving your clothes fresh, spotless, and ready to wear.', 5.00, 0.00, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-06-14 05:24:09.000000', '2026-09-05 14:02:01.000000', NULL),
(10, NULL, 0, 'is_single', 0, 'months', 'null', 0, 0, 'months', '9', 0.00, 'CODE128', 'Power Bank', 200.00, 250.00, 0.00, 0.00, 1, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0.00, '1', 0.00, '1', '49346520_power bank.jpg', 'Never run out of power when you need it most with an ultra-compact and high-capacity backup companion. Engineered with advanced fast-charging technology, it juices up your smartphones, tablets, and wireless gear at lightning speed. The intelligent multi-protection system shields your devices against overcharging, overheating, and short circuits for absolute peace of mind. Sleek, lightweight, and flight-approved, it slips effortlessly into your pocket or bag, keeping you fully charged and connected wherever life takes you.', 5.00, 0.00, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-06-14 05:26:03.000000', '2026-06-15 05:34:50.000000', NULL),
(11, NULL, 0, 'is_single', 0, 'months', 'null', 0, 0, 'months', '10', 0.00, 'CODE128', 'Headphone', 200.00, 322.00, 0.00, 250.00, 1, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0.00, '1', 0.00, '1', '96169508_headphone.png', 'Escape into your own world of pure, uninterrupted sound with a headphone engineered for true audiophiles. Featuring precision-tuned dynamic drivers, it delivers breathtaking high-resolution audio with crystal-clear highs and deep, immersive bass. The advanced ergonomic design, paired with ultra-soft memory foam earcups, ensures luxurious comfort for even the longest listening sessions. Equipped with seamless wireless connectivity and an extended battery life, it provides the ultimate soundtrack to your daily hustle, wherever you go.', 5.00, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-06-14 05:27:54.000000', '2026-09-05 14:01:01.000000', NULL),
(12, NULL, 0, 'is_single', 0, 'months', 'null', 0, 0, 'months', '24', 0.00, 'CODE128', 'SMA Pro', 10.00, 15.00, 13.00, 0.00, 3, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0.00, '1', 0.00, '1', '42703376_sma pro.png', NULL, 10.00, 0.00, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, '2026-07-24 16:57:36.000000', '2026-08-22 04:58:40.000000', NULL),
